and features of CLOS~\cite{ECOOP87-CLOS,CLOS-SPECIFICATION,CLTL2,CACM-CLOS}, Java~\cite{JLS1},
MultiJava~\cite{MULTIJAVA-OOPSLA-2000,MULTIJAVA-TOPLAS-2006},
